      "writtenOn": "2022-10-19T14:00:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, MMIO registers from crosvm are written to the memory before VM start. GuestVM will be able to read and write into this memory. Writes to INT_ACK is required during a data transfer. Crosvm checks for pending interrupts before injecting.",
